// About
"about_heading" = "About";
"about_body" = "Senior iOS Engineer with 6+ years of professional experience, plus 2 earlier years shipping production code while studying for my engineering degree, completed in July 2021. I take full ownership of features and architecture, from the first call to the release: I modernize legacy codebases, build atomic design systems, and treat testing as part of the craft, not an afterthought. On the App Store since 2018 with three shipped apps across iPhone, iPad and Mac. Recently I have carried that ownership past the app layer, into AI agentic workflows, full-stack IoT and hardware-software integration. Passionate about health and wellness technology. When I'm not shipping, I'm doing yoga, climbing, or kitesurfing.";
"about_availability" = "Available now, freelance or full-time: remote across the EU and the Americas, or relocation. Spanish passport, authorized to work in the EU.";

